        </div>

        <div class="product-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">REPLACE: Category · Product type</p>
          <h1>REPLACE: Product name</h1>
          <p>
            REPLACE: A short, factual introduction explaining what the product
            does, the problem it solves and why it may be useful.
          </p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a
              class="button dark"
              href="AFFILIATE_LINK_HERE"
